  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Psyc 305.01 Application Processing Procedures. The review of applications, withdrawal of applications, conditional denials, challenges of denials, notices, and the computation of time shall be in accordance with Plc 301.05 and Plc 304.06 through Plc 304.11.\n\nSource. #14232, eff 6-2-25",
